Output of NVIDIA's nvidia-smi (driver 580, CUDA 13.0) on a multi-GPU Linux
machine whose GPUs have compute capabilities 12.0, 8.6 and 7.5, run with an
empty environment:

  query-unit.xml   nvidia-smi --query -u -x
  compute-cap.csv  nvidia-smi --query-gpu=compute_cap --format=csv,noheader

The capture time in query-unit.xml is replaced by the Unix epoch. Neither
file holds serial numbers, UUIDs, PCI addresses or host names.
